  "title": "The First Tier",
  "subtitle": "\"At 11:47 on a Tuesday the sky cracked open and my PhD became useless. The System told me I was Rank F. It did not tell me I was the only person on the planet with a Null-affinity class.\"",
  "penName": "Corin Adler",
  "genre": "litrpgSystem",
  "hook": "At 11:47 on a Tuesday the sky cracked open. A blue text box appeared in my field of vision that said **AWAKENING IN PROGRESS. DESIGNATING: CORIN ADLER. RANK F. CLASS: LINGUIST (NULL AFFINITY).** I was a twenty-eight-year-old PhD candidate in medieval studies at Columbia. My dissertation was on phonological drift in Middle English. The first thing that tried to kill me was a translated version of a goblin. I stayed alive because I could read the original script on its armor. The second thing that tried to kill me was worse.",
